#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-make-content-addressed.md:24
msgid ""
"Since the resulting paths are content-addressed, they are always trusted and "
"don't need signatures to copied to another store:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-make-content-addressed.md:31
msgid ""
"By contrast, the original closure is input-addressed, so it does need "
"signatures to be trusted:"
msgstr ""

